1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Thirty-Third Episode
The Egyptian Adventure

15
00:02:22,421 --> 00:02:26,334
Here on the sea there is a lot of mist,
especially in winter!

16
00:02:26,421 --> 00:02:29,379
Often we don't notice the enemy
because of the mist.

17
00:02:29,421 --> 00:02:32,094
A day like today
is very dangerous,

18
00:02:32,141 --> 00:02:34,496
therefore it is important
to stay well on guard!

19
00:02:35,981 --> 00:02:37,972
An enemy ship!

20
00:02:41,101 --> 00:02:43,092
Who knows where it comes from...

21
00:02:50,341 --> 00:02:52,332
What could this possibly be?

22
00:02:55,421 --> 00:02:57,537
Don't worry.
Where do you come from?

23
00:02:57,581 --> 00:03:00,334
- Why are you wearing this
iron ring? - I escaped!

24
00:03:00,381 --> 00:03:04,135
Please, be kind, take this
horrible iron ring off me at once!

25
00:03:07,861 --> 00:03:09,977
Oh, no, I can't take it off you!

26
00:03:10,501 --> 00:03:12,412
What is this mark?

27
00:03:12,501 --> 00:03:15,618
This iron ring is the symbol
of the sacrifice to the deity.

28
00:03:17,501 --> 00:03:20,061
Sacrifice, you said?
What sacrifice?

29
00:03:20,101 --> 00:03:23,173
Every year, ten girls are
buried alive underground...

30
00:03:23,221 --> 00:03:25,496
...as a sacrifice to the
deity! Thank you very much!

31
00:03:25,581 --> 00:03:28,937
Buried alive?! How is
such cruelty possible?

32
00:03:32,021 --> 00:03:34,091
The persecutors are coming!

33
00:03:35,021 --> 00:03:38,730
- Quick, help me escape!
- Hide behind the Fort! Go!

34
00:03:50,501 --> 00:03:52,412
It won't open anymore!

35
00:03:58,341 --> 00:04:00,616
Which country's soldiers are you?

36
00:04:01,021 --> 00:04:04,218
Girl destined for sacrifice,
why did you run away?

37
00:04:04,261 --> 00:04:07,219
- You will be severely punished!
- But what are you talking about?

38
00:04:07,261 --> 00:04:10,094
I am Sapphire, the
Princess of Silverland!

39
00:04:10,141 --> 00:04:13,975
Shut up! You cannot deceive us
even if you have changed your clothes!

40
00:04:14,021 --> 00:04:18,014
You are a girl of our country
and the iron ring is the proof!

41
00:04:18,061 --> 00:04:20,450
That's enough! Take her to the ship!

42
00:05:08,901 --> 00:05:12,530
- I'm tired, let me sleep!
- Come on, wake up! You lazybones!

43
00:05:21,421 --> 00:05:23,810
Are you awake, beautiful girl?

44
00:05:27,221 --> 00:05:30,133
Who are you? And where am I?

45
00:05:30,181 --> 00:05:32,775
Are you still trying
to feign ignorance?

46
00:05:32,821 --> 00:05:35,858
There is no one in the world
who doesn't know this country!

47
00:05:35,901 --> 00:05:37,971
Look at that
great seaside city...

48
00:05:38,021 --> 00:05:41,297
...and look at those three
great pyramids in the desert!

49
00:05:43,301 --> 00:05:45,212
Great seaside city...

50
00:05:46,221 --> 00:05:48,098
Pyramids..!

51
00:05:48,181 --> 00:05:52,220
So, according to Dr. Uranaru,
this country is Egypt!

52
00:05:54,341 --> 00:05:57,253
This is the largest city
in Egypt: Alexandria.

53
00:05:57,301 --> 00:06:00,020
And I am Morpho,
the celebrant of rites.

54
00:06:01,021 --> 00:06:05,139
Morpho? Listen, Morpho,
you're wrong, I am not that girl!

55
00:06:06,741 --> 00:06:09,619
Do you still intend
to feign ignorance?

56
00:06:09,861 --> 00:06:14,013
Don't you think it's very honorable
to be a sacrificial victim?

57
00:06:14,940 --> 00:06:17,500
You were chosen
because you are beautiful!

58
00:06:19,340 --> 00:06:21,457
And furthermore,
by offering sacrifices,

59
00:06:21,500 --> 00:06:25,175
we can calm the wrath of Osiris
and this country will know peace.

60
00:06:25,220 --> 00:06:27,940
It's nonsense! A country
cannot become peaceful...

61
00:06:27,980 --> 00:06:30,336
...by offering sacrifices!
- Queen Deda wants you.

62
00:06:30,380 --> 00:06:32,656
...and nine other girls
to be offered in sacrifice!

63
00:06:32,700 --> 00:06:34,692
Ten girls? Damn!

64
00:06:34,740 --> 00:06:37,494
The ten beautiful girls
will be offered in sacrifice..

65
00:06:37,540 --> 00:06:40,009
...on the first night
of the splendid full moon!

66
00:06:41,660 --> 00:06:43,652
I must manage to escape!

67
00:06:46,580 --> 00:06:48,492
Absolutely!

68
00:06:50,500 --> 00:06:54,653
- What is happening to you?
- This iron ring hurts!

69
00:06:55,340 --> 00:06:59,095
- Please, take this ring off me!
- Well... All right!

70
00:07:02,620 --> 00:07:04,498
There you go!

71
00:07:10,020 --> 00:07:12,251
Damn! How dare you?

72
00:07:23,660 --> 00:07:25,652
It's between the two of us now!

73
00:07:27,300 --> 00:07:28,973
Halt!

74
00:07:32,300 --> 00:07:34,292
Prince Amensis?!

75
00:07:35,900 --> 00:07:39,416
I am the only son of the deceased
Queen Deda: Amensis.

76
00:07:41,220 --> 00:07:43,894
I am the Princess of Silverland:
Sapphire.

77
00:07:43,940 --> 00:07:46,614
Princess of Silverland?
I want to believe you!

78
00:07:46,660 --> 00:07:49,175
Judging by your skill
in using the sword,

79
00:07:49,220 --> 00:07:51,860
you are different from the normal girls
of this country.

80
00:07:51,900 --> 00:07:54,131
Let me go, please.

81
00:07:55,700 --> 00:07:57,498
What is it?

82
00:07:57,540 --> 00:08:00,612
I know they mistook you for another,
but I cannot decide alone..

83
00:08:00,660 --> 00:08:03,255
...what to do with you.
- But why?

84
00:08:03,740 --> 00:08:06,209
This country is large
and I have no power!

85
00:08:06,500 --> 00:08:08,492
I will hold a meeting and we will decide.

86
00:08:08,540 --> 00:08:10,896
Until then, please,
wait here!

87
00:08:13,260 --> 00:08:15,252
Prince Amensis...

88
00:08:20,820 --> 00:08:23,380
Come on, wake up!
Wake up, I said! Wake up!

89
00:08:23,420 --> 00:08:26,219
Wake up! Wake up! Wake
up! Wake up! Wake up!

90
00:08:29,820 --> 00:08:33,018
Listen, boy, is your parrot
good at imitating people?

91
00:08:33,060 --> 00:08:35,450
I can imitate anyone from any country!

92
00:08:35,580 --> 00:08:38,698
- Are you able to fly?
- I have flown all over the world!

93
00:08:39,700 --> 00:08:42,215
Don't believe him!
But he really can fly!

94
00:08:42,260 --> 00:08:46,379
What a fine friend! You meanie, you're
making me out to be a liar to everyone!

95
00:08:46,421 --> 00:08:48,377
Please, fly to my country!

96
00:08:48,421 --> 00:08:51,572
Tell a boy named Tink
to come help Sapphire!

97
00:08:51,621 --> 00:08:54,055
- It's very easy!
- I'll reward you later!

98
00:08:54,101 --> 00:08:56,899
- Alright! Where is your country?
- It's to the North!

99
00:08:56,941 --> 00:08:59,739
Go, fly to the North!
Go call Tink, understood?

100
00:09:00,021 --> 00:09:04,094
Away, to the North!
Away, to the North!

101
00:09:15,021 --> 00:09:18,855
Nine more girls!
I will be buried alive with them!

102
00:09:19,021 --> 00:09:23,094
Prince! Prince Amensis!
I can't go back!

103
00:09:23,741 --> 00:09:26,574
Prince!
Prince, what will become of me?

104
00:09:28,501 --> 00:09:31,618
You will be a sacrificial victim,
it's already been decided!

105
00:09:31,661 --> 00:09:33,652
Oh..! Oh, no!

106
00:09:34,541 --> 00:09:38,819
Since we cannot manage to bring back
the girl who escaped to your country,

107
00:09:39,661 --> 00:09:43,017
you must replace her
and sacrifice yourself in her place.

108
00:09:43,581 --> 00:09:46,653
We will prepare a
very honorable sacrificial ceremony.

109
00:09:46,701 --> 00:09:49,420
You will be offered
to the late Queen Deda.

110
00:09:51,141 --> 00:09:53,974
It is said that Deda
was the second woman...

111
00:09:54,021 --> 00:09:56,899
...most beautiful in the world,
after Cleopatra.

112
00:09:57,901 --> 00:10:02,179
She is dead and now lies
more beautiful than ever in the pyramid.

113
00:10:04,181 --> 00:10:08,254
But the youth and beauty
of the Queen will fade forever,

114
00:10:08,421 --> 00:10:12,130
if every year there are not
offered as sacrificial victims...

115
00:10:12,421 --> 00:10:14,935
...the ten most beautiful maidens
of the country.

116
00:10:15,621 --> 00:10:18,738
And you have ten poor girls killed just because you believe...

117
00:10:18,781 --> 00:10:21,773
- ...in a stupid superstition?
- A superstition?!

118
00:10:21,821 --> 00:10:24,699
Prince, do you also believe this implausible story?

119
00:10:25,101 --> 00:10:28,491
I believe it because Morpho believes it and assures me that it is the truth.

120
00:10:28,541 --> 00:10:33,092
I never tell lies! It is necessary to offer sacrificial victims.

121
00:10:33,141 --> 00:10:36,497
If we do not offer these victims, your late mother will be destroyed

122
00:10:36,541 --> 00:10:39,578
..and Osiris will punish Egypt!
- It's a lie, Prince!

123
00:10:39,621 --> 00:10:42,215
- Enough!
- I have nothing more to say!

124
00:10:42,741 --> 00:10:47,417
You and the other nine girls
will all be sacrificed in five days.

125
00:10:47,621 --> 00:10:50,181
Until then, enjoy yourselves
as much as you can.

126
00:10:55,141 --> 00:10:57,018
I will not die!

127
00:10:58,181 --> 00:11:00,536
Tink, what are you doing?

128
00:11:29,261 --> 00:11:32,571
But why is none of you
crying or trying to escape?

129
00:11:32,621 --> 00:11:35,010
I was chosen because I am beautiful.

130
00:11:35,221 --> 00:11:37,974
But were you perhaps
born to be buried alive?

131
00:11:40,781 --> 00:11:42,931
Listen, let's escape somehow.

132
00:11:42,981 --> 00:11:45,541
I'm sure we will manage to
save ourselves if we run away.

133
00:11:45,581 --> 00:11:47,412
- Sapphire!
- Tink!

134
00:11:47,661 --> 00:11:50,698
Are you Tink?
Prince Amensis...

135
00:11:51,221 --> 00:11:53,416
- There is only one
way to save you - How?

136
00:11:53,621 --> 00:11:57,409
It is to marry me! If you
marry me, you will not die!

137
00:11:58,741 --> 00:12:01,414
Please, marry me! I
like you very much!

138
00:12:02,341 --> 00:12:04,650
And I can make you truly happy!

139
00:12:08,701 --> 00:12:10,692
Choose another girl.

140
00:12:11,101 --> 00:12:14,616
I do not want to be saved
myself and let nine other girls die.

141
00:12:14,941 --> 00:12:18,820
You can still live for three days,
you know. I await your answer.

142
00:13:13,661 --> 00:13:15,652
Tink, where are you?

143
00:13:28,021 --> 00:13:32,492
Oh, beautiful girls, this is
a night of the full moon.

144
00:13:34,621 --> 00:13:36,691
Osiris...

145
00:13:37,541 --> 00:13:41,011
Please, receive these
sacrificial victims...

146
00:13:41,181 --> 00:13:45,891
...and please, offer youth
and beauty to Queen Deda.

147
00:13:48,221 --> 00:13:50,860
May Queen Deda be young!

148
00:13:50,901 --> 00:13:53,734
May Queen Deda be beautiful!

149
00:13:55,221 --> 00:13:58,691
Enough! No matter how much
you pray, the dead can never again...

150
00:13:58,741 --> 00:14:02,529
...return to being young and beautiful!
- Fear the wrath of Osiris!

151
00:14:02,581 --> 00:14:04,572
A dead woman does not bloom again!

152
00:14:04,621 --> 00:14:08,136
Have you gone mad from the
fear of becoming a sacrificial victim?

153
00:14:08,181 --> 00:14:12,094
Lead the victims to the pyramid
where Queen Deda is sleeping!

154
00:14:20,221 --> 00:14:23,497
Sapphire! Sapphire,
please, grant my request!

155
00:14:23,541 --> 00:14:25,816
Marry me now or it will be too late!

156
00:14:30,301 --> 00:14:31,620
No!

157
00:14:55,381 --> 00:14:58,134
Sapphire!
Sapphire!

158
00:14:58,901 --> 00:15:01,540
Tink, is that you?
Tink, where are you?

159
00:15:05,381 --> 00:15:08,373
Sapphire, I'm asking you
for the last time: marry me!

160
00:15:08,421 --> 00:15:12,130
Otherwise it will be too late!
- Prince Amensis...

161
00:15:12,381 --> 00:15:14,611
I don't want you to
die, Sapphire! Marry me!

162
00:15:14,661 --> 00:15:18,415
Even if you repeat it to
me endlessly, I won't do it!

163
00:15:18,501 --> 00:15:22,619
I am not so petty as to save
myself by letting the other girls die.

164
00:15:34,821 --> 00:15:37,494
If I did that,
it would be over for me.

165
00:15:47,221 --> 00:15:50,930
- Sapphire!
- Tink, I'm here!

166
00:15:51,581 --> 00:15:54,175
- What is it?
- Sapphire! - Sapphire!

167
00:15:57,901 --> 00:15:59,732
Get them!

168
00:16:04,181 --> 00:16:06,058
Oh, my God!

169
00:16:06,101 --> 00:16:08,740
Help! Help!
Help!

170
00:16:24,621 --> 00:16:26,532
Tink!

171
00:16:33,061 --> 00:16:35,529
Sapphire, how cowardly I
am! I don't have the courage...

172
00:16:35,581 --> 00:16:38,334
...to go against Morpho
and Osiris and save you.

173
00:16:39,101 --> 00:16:41,092
Please, don't die!

174
00:17:35,661 --> 00:17:38,733
Be careful not to step
on that black stone!

175
00:17:54,021 --> 00:17:56,296
I warned you,
stupid boy.

176
00:17:56,541 --> 00:17:59,897
In this pyramid there are
many traps to avoid thieves.

177
00:18:13,981 --> 00:18:17,894
Osiris, please, receive
these sacrificial victims.

178
00:18:28,421 --> 00:18:30,332
Goodbye forever!

179
00:18:35,941 --> 00:18:37,977
That will be your coffin!

180
00:18:40,421 --> 00:18:43,811
Great Osiris, please help
us, I don't want to die!

181
00:18:45,141 --> 00:18:47,211
Try to take courage.

182
00:18:48,501 --> 00:18:52,289
- Please, help us!
- Calm down and take courage.

183
00:18:52,341 --> 00:18:54,855
I am certain there is
a secret hole to escape.

184
00:18:54,901 --> 00:18:58,416
I am sure of it, because the pyramid
has many secret passages.

185
00:19:02,221 --> 00:19:04,212
I'm tired! I'm tired!

186
00:19:06,061 --> 00:19:08,575
Hel... Help!

187
00:19:09,421 --> 00:19:11,981
Help! Help!
A crocodile!

188
00:19:12,461 --> 00:19:15,214
Help! Help! Help!

189
00:19:15,261 --> 00:19:17,297
We are being attacked
from both sides!

190
00:19:20,781 --> 00:19:22,772
Thank you very much.

191
00:19:25,501 --> 00:19:28,095
You saved our lives.
Thank you!

192
00:19:28,661 --> 00:19:30,697
I'll be able to sell this boy well.

193
00:19:30,741 --> 00:19:34,017
He can be sold for about 300 gold.
Boss, it's a real fortune!

194
00:19:34,621 --> 00:19:37,135
- But what are you talking about?
- We are slave traders.

195
00:19:37,181 --> 00:19:41,015
You can be sold for 300 gold.
Don't you think that's a good price?

196
00:19:41,701 --> 00:19:47,014
You want to sell me?
No! No! No! No!

197
00:19:48,021 --> 00:19:51,411
No! No! No! No! No!
I have to help Sapphire!

198
00:19:51,461 --> 00:19:54,373
Let me go!
I really can't stay with you!

199
00:19:54,421 --> 00:19:58,130
Look, are you going to put me down,
yes or no?

200
00:20:05,101 --> 00:20:07,092
There is no hole!

201
00:20:07,541 --> 00:20:10,135
I would have sworn there
had to be one.

202
00:20:10,741 --> 00:20:13,938
Leave it alone, we have no
choice but to resign ourselves!

203
00:20:14,181 --> 00:20:18,299
Osiris, sacrifice, and this
sort of thing are superstitions.

204
00:20:18,341 --> 00:20:20,696
When you die you can no
longer become beautiful again!

205
00:20:20,741 --> 00:20:24,575
Don't say those things! I am
afraid of Osiris's punishment!

206
00:20:24,621 --> 00:20:27,533
And I am telling you that
there can be no punishment!

207
00:20:28,341 --> 00:20:30,332
The mummy!

208
00:20:58,141 --> 00:21:01,690
There is a secret door! Hurry
up! Quickly, let's escape from here!

209
00:21:13,901 --> 00:21:15,493
Come!

210
00:21:18,501 --> 00:21:20,571
Come, quickly! Here is the exit!

211
00:21:34,101 --> 00:21:36,012
Oh...! Morpho!

212
00:21:36,221 --> 00:21:38,257
Slave merchant,
this time these girls...

213
00:21:38,301 --> 00:21:41,418
..they have given me a lot of trouble
because of this girl.

214
00:21:41,461 --> 00:21:43,372
Slave merchant?!

215
00:21:44,621 --> 00:21:47,931
It seems to me that this year the girls
are quite beautiful, right?

216
00:21:47,981 --> 00:21:50,814
- You will pay a good price.
- All right. - I understand, Morpho!

217
00:21:50,901 --> 00:21:52,857
Every year
you choose beautiful girls,

218
00:21:52,901 --> 00:21:55,210
saying that you offer them
as sacrificial victims..

219
00:21:55,261 --> 00:21:57,616
...and instead you sell them
to a slave merchant!

220
00:21:57,901 --> 00:22:00,415
Isn't it a good trick
to say that I kill them...

221
00:22:00,461 --> 00:22:02,372
..to protect
the Queen's beauty.

222
00:22:02,421 --> 00:22:04,412
..and to appease the wrath of Osiris?

223
00:22:04,781 --> 00:22:07,295
- Tie up the slaves!
- Let me go!

224
00:22:12,501 --> 00:22:16,574
Damn! Did they really have to
shut me in a jar full of pepper?

225
00:22:19,421 --> 00:22:21,298
Sapphire!

226
00:22:21,341 --> 00:22:25,380
If they found me now I could no longer
save Sapphire! What can I do?

227
00:22:26,741 --> 00:22:28,618
I've got it!

228
00:22:28,901 --> 00:22:31,369
Father in heaven,
please forgive me,

229
00:22:31,421 --> 00:22:33,696
but I'll have to make
the camels eat some pepper.

230
00:22:33,741 --> 00:22:35,732
I'm sorry, camels

231
00:22:42,741 --> 00:22:44,618
What's happening?

232
00:22:46,341 --> 00:22:48,457
Tink, you've finally arrived!

233
00:22:50,661 --> 00:22:52,572
Forward, Morpho!

234
00:22:55,381 --> 00:22:57,815
Forward...
Wait!

235
00:23:06,581 --> 00:23:08,572
Here I am, Morpho!

236
00:23:23,821 --> 00:23:27,814
Morpho! Leave her alone
